    "table_purpose": "Post-treatment follow-up and end-of-study schedule",
    "page_start": 129,
    "page_end": 130,
    "notes": "Appendix 12 'SCHEDULE OF ACTIVITIES: Follow-up and End of Study', doc p.129 (grid and footnotes 1-3, raster image) with footnotes 4-16 on doc p.130 (text layer). Typed main_soa: a separately printed, sequential phase (follow-up then end of study) that every participant passes through, with its own visit numbering; sequence alone does not make it a track (prompt section 2). One label column (L=1); data columns 2-4 (Follow-up x2, EOS). 'See Section 8' (row 20) and 'See Section 5.11' (row 21) are cells spanning every data column whose whole text is a pointer: emitted as source_notes pr1/pr2, no schedule entries. Redaction boxes cover the Visit Identifier and Visit Window rows and seven body cells (recorded as '[redacted in source]'). Doc p.130 holds footnotes only and contributes no rows."
  },
